{"id":"vod_jy_162875","vodId":"162875","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"爆走猎人","name_cn":"爆走猎人","date":"1995-01-01","year":"1995","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第26集完结","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/d35efe17c288afa7d510abaad5ed0bea.jpg"},"summary":"由人气作家赤堀悟担纲原作的同名漫画被改编成了动画。这也是XEBEC公司制作的第一个动画作品。这部电视版的内容相对严肃，不过还有风格更接近原作、充满色情元素的OVA版本问世。在由拥有魔法能力的特权阶级——法师们统治的斯普尔纳大陆上，有一群专门消灭邪恶法师的“黑暗法师猎人”在活跃着。作为猎人的年轻男子卡洛特，以及蒂拉和巧克力这对美丽姐妹等五人，他们四处打击恶徒，但最终，卡洛特体内潜藏的毁灭之神……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画,奇幻,日本动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-11-02 14:32:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/aOYErjQd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/eVO5BzBa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dwpEBDze/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/epYR0pma/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/en5YpqPd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/eXD7Ezoe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bDkY5nka/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dyP6EBgb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/en5Ypqpd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/elYvnyVa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dG6YjJ3b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/b4xk7okb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/eZ6wJx8e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/aADQ5Lpe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/erkEwGBa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/aM8Epz1e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dwpEBDXe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/ejRvljBe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第19集",